      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "303955f798e948718f3a5f83e7e324e3acd6445cb84849f35d171e7fe0b3f87f",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "111eed9fba46d58e777dac7631e7730f291d92d43067f9303a2d4c500732563b",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee5f031ab83331510c76affe636dc7e12f7a2dc435580492873421fc6cbdafac",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e6492039a4acd700ec63f2877ff1cc38dd6abf019a9ad996a6ceb880c078de1",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9058e1cb05e632013d830a0a7453fd1160e2e2ede72cb073a360cdda8847e50",
      "text": "Another classic use case for LLMs is classification.",
      "hash": "21b7794f0505653165420834283bed52825ee849fabc8dc4cef99383dfd1682a"
    },
    {
      "id": "33113bbe638881341fdb1254289d8d77b375c3b02951ff78f80b70b8b2bde2ae",
      "text": "Let's say we want to pass a user comment to the LLM to classify as",
      "hash": "dc63b7f7ff073d0deb329256750a1349fbc05469c1877f97e47e85fbb0213771"
    },
    {
      "id": "f752d02eab1a4013fcd032e71addac6e1e6cdee365855fac0df1dd406b517c2e",
      "text": ", or",
      "hash": "3d30020b1863441a64e786bdc72745e998a1e3abd32100e1b043bfa7a01b9095"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d9478a3a8a72642c772ab91e3f4249aefe0eb21e3e9c2fba0c96b7a92cd8e9d",
      "text": "We want to get back from the LLM essentially one string, and that string is going to be either",
      "hash": "84d46da2b4bd18e712e810a420ba122aa7dc04b54a3fc13e8f039a1d040aa8c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8bc82eb526693e5f61aa6406d65c48d44ff5c10e091941e0c6ef1a934c47f90",
      "text": "In traditional software parlance, this is called an enum — a set of enumerated values.",
      "hash": "a0efbe82f59829eebbe104fb13eab33d5eae3636cc98111dd627852a10a8ee54"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b093b7ac534d657f0f1bd9f51fb2b87c30747f1fc5db96fc43937b0b7002637",
      "text": "And we can use the AI SDK to generate that enum.",
      "hash": "9e635cf3558744363cf2a31bd8a4ba9467fe875ebc40feebc210fb11b5f90506"
    },
    {
      "id": "0875f85a083d5676d935e497343ea5169fe23459f9fdbe4b0781bd81d602a875",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "56e8c65b37817568ac28bc226ce936a95ba656f89ebc022092366870a258a297",
      "text": "We're using the",
      "hash": "48cc6fb3ac71877ac80065df12c8b4a9034c8a4a16080b4742a56068c04cd460"
    },
    {
      "id": "f04dedf770f609f8bc8fd01e7174c41540fa7043c2e8fb57c0f3f690f343dfcc",
      "text": "function again, but this time we're passing an output of",
      "hash": "e5303927d5e8da4f6a48768c873a8bf8ec7c8c21af13f6d8147693daf2710529"
    },
    {
      "id": "d049749ff83c204aeda839360e9d76afda0ab9d1f6ae39eda519722e1af8e857",
      "text": "We also pass an",
      "hash": "abb04846d7a8a3563b76b69811b73cf775b64b033f72691dc3f59d41af24bacf"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c24201fc80cf0dc42e9f18d856b05543bafcae7eadae13fe914a14064a66b85",
      "text": "property with an array of the possible strings we want it to return.",
      "hash": "aca7d80b351cc448568139ee46d7df37909f968278431a1b0e337684fd4a55be"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb900a1cb463daea948975d37691096bf3d36f04860b5a0daa0409a21a651897",
      "text": "The result we get back from",
      "hash": "8968011aa4eca29682aeaf5c16967229d756f6786c8acf965469ef78e4e03984"
    },
    {
      "id": "8466cd5bc2a876875dd8b7f7371f3ad101aef1c2295e77eaf128c7eef6bd4274",
      "text": "has an",
      "hash": "f6ca6dd9d111b5b6f23e703f20cb16e2aa7752de4338fb67307ab4bede7f841a"
    },
    {
      "id": "a44366c7f7e68903c35cb59c9b8152dea1b1cd76190cbbcca0e619d027ac09b6",
      "text": "property, and that object is our enum.",
      "hash": "e9220e5428bcea025de825c23f89295b193f448d18d5eb4a1ff580b7571387d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "57da9fd7b4b0d6b0e67f5b8c668e3270911a4e87815b0b1036ee7a72e3621eb6",
      "text": "Let's try out a few different statements to see if it works:",
      "hash": "8466de338cbda39f1239df02e233ae6e51df5915b9effc3aac9f649334f8744a"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ee0d408a265617994225b8cb490c01392c83fe97fff73e1ebac5048fd3cbd1d",
      "text": "comes out as",
      "hash": "75bdb3cd6b2681853748782efe6efcf59c73d25446094c6f0c22a7255c8507cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "07fbfa86c9e6f49778b4ffe05b5428f6f52f091a0b69f2b18fc016c7603e0c21",
      "text": "And",
      "hash": "0f67514b901da8b9c613167848294cb0010b3c0e696732aa1a0c9737e5be69b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5c313f4870fafa982c8d94f4327e8e0d48a3167696ccae5ff2c9a26a2a19b7c6",
      "text": "And just like that, we've got a sentiment analysis system. This is a really cool use case for enums, and it's great that the AI SDK makes it so simple.",
      "hash": "55c07e0484ae7041c939209b1339a744f22d312f0f70d381f5d4d78f3077dfd3"
    },
    {
      "id": "854395303276cb11808f8b8fcb29e549325aa62cca0d85695427b122e5b34951",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
